An initial baseline attempt ran the candidate test module from the candidate checkout with only the extracted baseline src directory on PYTHONPATH. The test module imports `src.rvl_systems`, so the current working directory took precedence and the test loaded the candidate code. Its passing result is not evidence for baseline behavior. The checked baseline import path showed a different top-level package (`rvl_systems` rather than `src.rvl_systems`), so this attempt was discarded. The corrected run copied the candidate regression test into an extracted pinned-baseline source tree and ran from that tree; see baseline-regression-corrected.log.
